<div class="section" id="section-one">
<h1><a class="toc-backref" href="#toc-entry-1">Section One</a></h1>
<p>Paragraph with <em>emphasis</em>, <strong>strong</strong>, <tt class="docutils literal">literal</tt>, <cite>interpreted</cite>,
<sub>sub</sub> and <sup>sup</sup> text, a <a class="reference external" href="https://example.org/">reference</a> <a class="footnote-reference" href="#footnote-4" id="footnote-reference-6">[4]</a>, an <a class="reference external" href="https://example.org/anon">anonymous one</a> <a class="footnote-reference" href="#footnote-5" id="footnote-reference-7">[5]</a>, a
footnote <a class="footnote-reference" href="#footnote-1" id="footnote-reference-1">[1]</a>, an auto footnote <a class="footnote-reference" href="#footnote-2" id="footnote-reference-2">[2]</a>, labeled <a class="footnote-reference" href="#lbl" id="footnote-reference-3">[3]</a>, symbol <a class="footnote-reference" href="#footnote-3" id="footnote-reference-4">[*]</a> and a
citation <a class="citation-reference" href="#cit2002" id="citation-reference-1">[CIT2002]</a>.  Inline <span class="target" id="target">target</span> here; replaced <em>text</em> too.  Standalone
<a class="reference external" href="https://example.org/x?y=1#z">https://example.org/x?y=1#z</a> and <a class="reference external" href="mailto:me&#64;example.org">mailto:me&#64;example.org</a>, <a class="reference external" href="mailto:me&#64;example.org">me&#64;example.org</a>.</p>
